<title>HONG KONG: Citibank names global finance business head for HK.</title>
<headline>Citibank names global finance business head for HK.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank said on Thursday it appointed Ignatius Chan Tze Ching as head of its global finance business for Hong Kong.</p>
<p>Chan will be responsible for the bank's wholesale banking business serving corporate and institutional customers, and will report to Stephen Long, country corporate officer for Citibank Hong Kong and North Asia division head for commercial and investment banking.</p>
<p>He was previously country treasurer for Citibank Hong Kong.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6441</p>
